  "contract": "Only periodic Tremor damage grants Geomolding: one stack per tick, 3 additional Rage and 10% Terrasurge damage per stack, up to ten. The next Terrasurge consumes all stacks; direct damage, unlearning, unrelated spells and expiry are controls. Specialization 95 (Geomancy) grants Crushing the Earth (300697) automatically; its two-second refresh adds spell power after the baselines are taken, so the scenario removes it and keeps spell power constant. Terrasurge damage probes query a creature: normal class 887019 (-15%) and Geomancy 887086 (+23%) tuning scale the 1000 base to 1045, so ten stacks read 2091/1045 after truncation and the doubled damage uses a 1.999-2.001 window. Tremor and Terrasurge casts still target the enemy player."
